              %li
                %p
                  (fourth summand) Since this involves three factors of
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi F
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
                  which jointly pick up one minus sign when the indices on each of them are exchanged simultaneously, this vanishes by the same kind of skew-symmetry argument as for the second term.
              %li
                %p
                  (fifth summand) Since this is the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/determinant"} determinant
                  of a
